  "solution_ref": "ㄱ: $g(0)=0$ → $[0,1]$에서 $f\\ge0$ ($a\\ge1$) → $\\int_{-1}^0f<0$, $g(-1)<0$ (참). ㄴ: $g(-1)>0$이면 $[0,1]$에서 $f\\le0$, $g(-1)=\\int_{-1}^1f=-\\frac{2(a+1)}3>0$ → $a<-1$ (참). ㄷ: $g(-1)>1$ → $a<-\\frac52$, $g(0)=2\\int_0^1f=\\frac13a-\\frac16<-1$ (참)",
